msgid ""
"The BE4FOSS project was funded by the Federal Environment Agency and the "
"Federal Ministry for the Environment, Nature Conservation, Nuclear Safety "
"and Consumer Protection (BMUV<sup><a id=\"fnr.1\" class=\"footref\" href="
"\"#fn.1\">1</a></sup>). The funds are made available by resolution of the "
"German Bundestag."
msgstr ""
"Projektet BE4FOSS grundades av det federala miljödepartementet och det "
"federala ministeriet för miljö, naturvård, kärnkraftssäkerhet och "
"konsumentskydd (BMUV<sup><a id=\"fnr.1\" class=\"footref\" href=\"#fn.1\">1</"
"sup>). Medel tillhandahålls genom beslut av den Tyska Förbundsdagen."

#: content/blog/2022-02-07-kde-eco-2021-sprint.md:144
#: content/blog/2022-03-05-energy-conservation-day.md:39
#: content/blog/post-1.md:65
msgid ""
"<img src=\"/blog/images/bmuv.png\" alt=\"BMUV logo\" width=\"340px\"/>\n"
msgstr ""
"<img src=\"/blog/images/bmuv.png\" alt=\"BMUV logo\" width=\"340px\"/>\n"

#: content/blog/2022-02-07-kde-eco-2021-sprint.md:146
#: content/blog/2022-03-05-energy-conservation-day.md:41
