"Germany. Three KDE community members -- Joseph P. De Veaugh-Geiss, Alexander "
"Lohnau, and Harri Porten -- were on stage to receive the award on behalf of "
"Okular and the KDE community."
msgstr ""

#: content/blog/2022-09-28_okular_blue-angel-award-ceremony.md:29
msgid ""
"EnviroInfo is an international and interdisciplinary conference with a focus "
"on environmental issues in information and communication technologies. "
